mission "The Last Pilot of the Crown"
    name "The Last Pilot of the Crown"
    description "Find retired pilot Tomas Vale, whose family once guided the lost expedition."
    source "Havana"
    destination "Crown's Fall"
    reward 1070
    speaker offer "Tomas Vale"
    speaker visit "Tomas Vale"
    speaker complete "Tomas Vale"
    to offer
        has "A Convenient Forgery: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Find retired pilot Tomas Vale, whose family once guided the lost expedition.`
            `Tomas Vale studies you for a moment. "The old sea charter settled one war, but it did not settle the past. The lost expedition sailed west under a sealed order, and its wake is stirring every ambitious captain in these waters."
            choice
                `(I will help uncover what happened.)`
                    accept
                `(Tell me what you are not saying.)`
                    goto details
                `(I have no wish to be drawn into another quarrel.)`
                    close
            label details
                `Tomas Vale lowers their voice. "The maps were altered, the convoy erased from the books, and someone has been buying witnesses. Follow the evidence, not the flags."`
                choice
                    `(Then I will take the matter in hand.)`
                        accept
                    `(Not today.)`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Last Pilot of the Crown. Find retired pilot Tomas Vale, whose family once guided the lost expedition."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Tomas Vale receives you at Crown's Fall. The evidence fits another piece into the puzzle: the expedition was not searching for gold alone, but for a place deliberately removed from every official chart.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Tomas Vale thanks you. "Every answer makes the sea less simple, captain. Yet the truth belongs to the people who live here, not to the first crown or company that can put a seal upon it."`
        log "Completed The Last Pilot of the Crown. Received 1070 gold. Find retired pilot Tomas Vale, whose family once guided the lost expedition."
